    {
      "gate_id": "EVIDENCE_GRADE_PAPER_EXECUTION",
      "status": "PASS",
      "summary": "Paper orders and trades preserve explicit fill, fee, slippage, and position evidence.",
      "checks": [
        "Only risk-approved signals can execute.",
        "Modeled execution enforces a conservative cost floor.",
        "Imported paper evidence preserves source hashes and reconciliation context.",
        "Local native intake uses the same services without external delivery receipts.",
        "The bounded SQLite native processor commits outcomes, cursors and paper effects together; it is not a continuous feed or source attestation.",
        "The initial seed is retained atomically and reconstructed prefixes are verified; versioned continuation preserves replay arithmetic beyond the fixed prefix window.",
        "Continuation state is reconstructed from retained inputs with paged receipt reads; audit time and storage still grow, and stale entries remain rejected.",
        "Exit-only recovery accepts contiguous closed candles without entry authority; touched positions are quarantined from qualifying forward-paper evidence.",
        "Versioned source-bound observations retain raw acquisition evidence atomically with seed/checkpoint/recovery effects; imports cannot grant origin or entry authority.",
        "The one-shot observer owns public acquisition, checks its planned stream head at commit and persists observation admission; default observation cannot enter. The opt-in Jam coordinator is separately risk-gated; neither mode schedules itself or grants forward qualification.",
        "Explicit acquired-candle exit management commits costed FLAT/HELD/CLOSED outcomes with v6 receipts, preserves recovery quarantine and cannot qualify OHLC-model fills.",
        "Bounded Jam features are reconstructed from audited retained history under an enforced read-only SQLite snapshot, bound to full settings and the exact head; this is not a decision, candidate approval, or a supervised runner.",
        "Pure Jam proposals preserve pending confirmation, explicit entry resolution, old-bracket-first exits and next-bar stop updates. They do not write receipts, approve risk, prove fills or qualify a candidate.",
        "The v7 Jam coordinator reconstructs setup/management state, records real risk decisions and modeled paper effects in the receipt transaction, verifies costs and equity, and preserves conservative partial-bar and exit-phase semantics. Its OHLC fills remain nonqualifying; Jam retirement and live locks remain intact.",
        "A bounded cooperative local supervisor owns polling, resource and clock stops, OS-held process locking, rate-limit waits and durable run journals. Separate read-only reconciliation checks retained receipt references. These controls do not prove continuous real-feed operation or deployment acceptance."
      ],
